  "offchainApis": [],
  "actions": [
    {
      "name": "transfer",
      "description": "Send USDT on a chain",
      "how": "contract USDT.transfer(to, amount) on that chain; on Ethereum, do not require a bool return value"
    },
    {
      "name": "approve",
      "description": "Let a protocol spend USDT",
      "how": "On Ethereum: if allowance(owner, spender) > 0, call USDT.approve(spender, 0) first, then USDT.approve(spender, amount)"
    },
    {
      "name": "check-blacklist",
      "description": "Check whether an address is frozen by Tether (Ethereum)",
      "how": "contract USDT.isBlackListed(address) on Ethereum"
    },
    {
      "name": "balance",
      "description": "Read a USDT balance",
      "how": "contract USDT.balanceOf(address); 6 decimals on Ethereum"
    }
  ],
  "risks": [
    "Centralised issuer: Tether's Terms of Service reserve the right to freeze Tether Tokens, blacklist any address holding them, bar transactions to or from addresses, and seize or recover tokens (tether.to/en/legal).",
    "USDT on Ethereum: owner can addBlackList(address); a blacklisted address cannot transfer, and destroyBlackFunds(address) zeroes its balance and burns it from supply (verified source).",
    "USDT on Ethereum does not return bool from transfer/transferFrom/approve; strict ERC-20 callers that require a bool will revert.",
    "USDT on Ethereum approve reverts when changing a non-zero allowance to another non-zero value; reset to 0 first.",
    "USDT on Ethereum can be deprecated by the owner, after which calls are forwarded to upgradedAddress(); owner can also pause transfers.",
    "Only chains listed on tether.to/en/supported-protocols are issued/redeemed by Tether. Tether lists Algorand, Vaulta/EOS, Kusama, Omni, Bitcoin Cash SLP as deprecated (no longer issued or redeemable obligation), EUR₮ as wound down, and CNH₮ redemption ending February 20, 2027."
  ],
  "notes": "Addresses are exactly as listed on https://tether.to/en/supported-protocols/ (EVM ones checksummed here). USDT on Kava is listed by Tether as \"Cosmos (via Kava)\". Not included: USDT0 / XAUt0 (the LayerZero OFT omnichain versions developed by Everdawn Labs) because tether.to's supported-protocols page does not list them; USDT on chains such as Arbitrum, Polygon, Optimism or BNB Chain is not on Tether's official list (bridged or USDT0 versions exist there) and is omitted. The no-bool / approve-reset behaviour and blacklist functions are confirmed only for the Ethereum USDT contract (verified source); other chains' USDT contracts are different deployments, so read their ABI (get_abi) before relying on return values. Deprecated tokens with addresses on the official page (historical only): EUR₮ Ethereum 0xC581b735A1688071A1746c968e0798D642EDE491, CNH₮ Ethereum 0x6e109e9dd7fa1a58bc3eff667e8e41fc3cc07aef, CNH₮ Tron TCfCGjekyqmdYt1yxfUM5v5SDtaY6tuWik, MXN₮ Tron TDp7Kbp6ajeWeQN9J57Vnw4WyQdKpuARDF, USD₮ Algorand asset 312769, Kusama AssetHub 1984, Omni property #31. Minting/redemption is via tether.to accounts (KYC), not an on-chain contract call.",
